Shelly says thanks, too.

484
00:20:33,811 --> 00:20:35,611
Just keep off the stilts, okay?

485
00:20:35,951 --> 00:20:37,371
Are you sure about this, though?

486
00:20:37,731 --> 00:20:39,391
