487
00:20:39,711 --> 00:20:40,631
Yeah, you jerk.

488
00:20:40,631 --> 00:20:43,211
How do you think he feels being left with those weirdos?

489
00:20:45,031 --> 00:20:49,591
Poopy.

490
00:20:51,171 --> 00:20:52,311
Poor little guy.

491
00:20:53,031 --> 00:20:54,471
Chopper, I'm sorry.

492
00:20:55,011 --> 00:20:57,151
I know this is hard on you, but no matter what,

493
00:20:57,211 --> 00:20:59,711
I promise we'll win the next game and get you back.

494
00:20:59,811 --> 00:21:01,451
So hang on a little longer, okay?

495
00:21:01,671 --> 00:21:03,211
I know you can take it.

496
00:21:05,351 --> 00:21:07,111
After all, you're a man, right?

497
00:21:10,151 --> 00:21:11,651
You bet I am!

498
00:21:13,071 --> 00:21:14,151
That's our Chopper.

499
00:21:15,031 --> 00:21:16,631
Leave it to me, little pal.

500
00:21:16,791 --> 00:21:18,071
You'll be just fine.

501
00:21:18,611 --> 00:21:20,671
If you're Chopper's last hope, he's screwed.

502
00:21:22,071 --> 00:21:24,291
I wonder what the next game's going to be.

503
00:21:25,051 --> 00:21:27,131
Whatever it is, I'm ready for it.

504
00:21:28,611 --> 00:21:30,971
We're gonna have Chopper back in no time!

505
00:21:31,471 --> 00:21:32,011
You bet I'm gonna haverich.

506
00:21:34,811 --> 00:21:35,471
I know.

507
00:21:35,811 --> 00:21:36,731
We have the genius to share we've seen.

508
00:21:36,751 --> 00:21:37,851
We're doing it again.

509
00:21:38,271 --> 00:21:39,471
We have the highest value to see.

510
00:21:39,671 --> 00:21:40,131
We've seen him.

511
00:21:40,331 --> 00:21:41,891
We have the highest memory, everyone, left me.

512
00:21:42,091 --> 00:21:42,631
We've seen him before we run.

513
00:21:42,631 --> 00:22:12,611
